From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:14:45 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] WebNN: the ONNX Runtime backend depends on fp16 itself

On Windows it got fp16's include path only through the TFLite backend,
which is off here (webnn_use_tflite = false).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 services/webnn/BUILD.gn | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/webnn/BUILD.gn b/services/webnn/BUILD.gn
index d7ccc44b4ecec5034cc5a0027a2a71cbf02c61db..11a814b762fdb1394e935494af9d295e2ba184b5 100644
--- a/services/webnn/BUILD.gn
+++ b/services/webnn/BUILD.gn
@@ -243,6 +243,8 @@ component("webnn_service") {
     ]
     deps += [
       "//services/webnn/public/cpp:win",
+      # Also there through TFLite, unless TFLite is off.
+      "//third_party/fp16",
       "//third_party/windows_app_sdk_headers",
     ]
 
